# resale-ops locations (owner config)

Load these IDs before any resale work. If Google Drive MCP is connected, confirm they match `Resale/.resale-locations.json`. Do not ask the owner for folder or spreadsheet IDs unless this block is missing or invalid.

Follow the **resale-ops** skill at `skills/resale-ops/SKILL.md`.

