## Routine

- Phone uploads → `queue/<item-id>/inbox/` (parent folder: `queue_folder_id`)
- Sanitize → `photos/post/` (temp workspace + `scripts/resale_queue.py` or equivalent)
- Persist `listing.md`, `meta.json` in the item folder; update **Queue** sheet via Sheets MCP
- `prepare_only`: no marketplace login or auto-publish

Forks: replace IDs in this file or use User rules + your own Drive `.resale-locations.json`.
